<title>UK: Rabobank ups 10-year bond to 350 billion lire.</title>
<headline>Rabobank ups 10-year bond to 350 billion lire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 350 billion lire from 300 billion lire, lead manager Credito Italiano said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT   *350 BLN ITL   COUPON  ***10.0	MATURITY    06.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE**101.50    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES  *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 21.JAN.97 FOR 250 BILLION LIRE.</p>
<p>	  **NEW ISSUE PRICE.</p>
<p>	  ***FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN 19.5 PCT LESS (2 X 6M LIBOR)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
